## Why This Is Asked

This question probes practical NUMA-aware memory management, race-free migration, and measurement under contention.

## Key Concepts

- NUMA locality
- Page migration and pte updates
- Atomic synchronization and CAS
- TLB shootdown and cache coherence
- Contention control and testing

## Code Example

```c
typedef struct {
  int node;
  atomic_int heat;
  atomic_bool migrating;
} page_meta_t;

void try_migrate(page_t *p, int new_node) {
  if (atomic_load(&p->migrating)) return;
  if (atomic_exchange(&p->migrating, true)) return;
  // update pte, migrate data to new_node
  atomic_store(&p->node, new_node);
  // flush/invalidate as needed
  atomic_store(&p->migrating, false);
}
```

